  "limitations": [
    "Art is unapproved; the style41 reference was generated by an image model, so its pixel clusters are not native hand-placed pixels.",
    "The generated reference is not geometrically identical to v05: see alignment; mask equality alone proves nothing about rim fit.",
    "Honey-locust crowns: the reference draws full crowns, the v05 masks are open sparse crowns, so the reference leaves outside the masks are baked into ground-far and will draw under the hero when she stands behind a tree (speckled crown).",
    "Granite seats, under-deck planters, bench, stair and bin sit 1-4 px off their v05 silhouettes in the reference (alignment best shifts), so thin rims of the wrong surface ride on those planes and in the backdrop next to them.",
    "Top rim: the reference's art starts at row 61, v05's at row 62 (one row of facade where v05 has the dark strip).",
    "Hidden clean-plate pixels are old-style v05 art and will show in the reveal window when the hero stands behind a prop.",
    "Not run in Godot by the producer (no import/render in this checkout); root must verify entry, interactions, occlusion and captures."
  ],
